WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:02.175
Git does not store diffs

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.350
Every commit points to a tree

3
00:00:06.475 --> 00:00:08.550
The tree lists files by the hash of their

4
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.575
contents

5
00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:11.475
Same contents

6
00:00:11.525 --> 00:00:12.175
same hash

7
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.350
stored once

8
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.400
Rename a file and the blob does not change

9
00:00:17.587 --> 00:00:19.650
only the tree gets a new name

10
00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.800
That is why renames are free

11
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.400
and why git diff is computed when you ask

12
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.650
not stored

13
00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:29.675
Pack files add compression later

14
00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:30.800
with deltas

15
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.075
but that is storage

16
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.275
not the model

17
00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.750
The model is simple

18
00:00:35.888 --> 00:00:36.425
a commit

19
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.000
a tree

20
00:00:37.038 --> 00:00:37.800
and blobs

21
00:00:37.888 --> 00:00:40.175
all addressed by what they contain

